GT patch 0043: texture level mode 1 (constant level) samples the level its offset names for decoded textures too,
not only for render targets (as the DX12 backend and PPSSPP do). GT draws millions of race draws in mode 1 with
offset 0, which 0039 sampled with the automatic level.

